isputes the decision and lodged an appeal on October first. Sanctions are a separate stage, and this does not automatically hand Liverpool the 2019 or 2022 titles. Those seasons also fall outside the financial period just described. But here is my view: findings of this scale demand more than a shrug. Financial rules cannot be treated as boring paperwork when the whole point of them is to protect the contest we are watching. Klopp did not need to predict every detail to be right that the principle mattered.", "voice_id": "bu5eKETbFKC8G702EAU4", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"}